      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Credentials: the CI of your project.\nSilenced checkers, `as any`, \"for now\" comments, complex functions: your ESLint config, so the lint step fails on them.\nA step that could not run (bad config, bad pattern) fails the gate. It is never a pass.",
      "originalText": "Credentials: the CI of your project.\nSilenced checkers, `as any`, \"for now\" comments, complex functions: your ESLint config, so the lint step fails on them.\nA step that could not run (bad config, bad pattern) fails the gate. It is never a pass.",
      "rawText": "Credentials: the CI of your project.\nSilenced checkers, `as any`, \"for now\" comments, complex functions: your ESLint config, so the lint step fails on them.\nA step that could not run (bad config, bad pattern) fails the gate. It is never a pass.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
